    "annotation": "From ALTO OCR output to annotated text and keywords: the text lines of each document (ATRIUM OCR post-processing, CPU), their lemmas, syntax and named entities from LINDAT UDPipe and NameTag with a TEITOK file that keeps each word's position (ATRIUM NLP enrichment, Czech), and the keywords of every document and page (ATRIUM keyword extraction, YAKE). One document record per document collects the stages' blocks.",
